<title>SINGAPORE: Excel Machine hits S$0.68 at open.</title>
<headline>Excel Machine hits S$0.68 at open.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore-based Excel Machine Tools Ltd hit a high of Singapore $0.68 against its initial public offer (IPO) of S$0.63 at its debut on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>At 0910 GMT, the shares were at S$0.645 and led the actives with over 4.6 million shares traded</p>
<p>Excel, which designs, makes and markets machine tools, had offered a total of 43.75 million shares comprsing 35 million new shares and 8.75 million vendor shares on March 17.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
